{"id":"cf82a002b0914cd1","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-cardinal-collapse-poset.md","title":"ZFC Cardinal Collapse Poset","display":"df-zfc-cardinal-collapse-poset — ZFC Cardinal Collapse Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cardinal-collapse-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cardinal-collapse-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-cardinal-collapse-poset — ZFC Cardinal Collapse Poset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cardinal-collapse-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cardinal-collapse-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cardinal-collapse-poset — ZFC Cardinal Collapse Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(M,P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span> (ground model, condition carrier, order, and cardinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\)</span> (forcing-relation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CardinalCollapsePoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CardinalCollapsePoset}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}collapse\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{CardinalCollapsePoset}_S(P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa,\\lambda,M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\land\\exists 1_{\\mathbb P}\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\bigl(M,1_{\\mathbb P},\\ulcorner |x_0|\\leq|x_1|\\urcorner,\\langle\\check\\lambda,\\check\\kappa\\rangle,P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}collapse\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{CardinalCollapsePoset}_S(P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa,\\lambda,M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\land\\exists 1_{\\mathbb P}\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\bigl(M,1_{\\mathbb P},\\ulcorner |x_0|\\leq|x_1|\\urcorner,\\langle\\check\\lambda,\\check\\kappa\\rangle,P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The forcing claim is now attached to a greatest condition and to the declared forcing-relation predicate; the former expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\\Vdash\\cdots\">\\(\\mathbb P\\Vdash\\cdots\\)</span> treated a poset as a forcing condition.</li>\n<li>The condition carrier, order, and ground model are explicit arguments, matching the six-place forcing-relation contract; order comparison is relation membership rather than infix use of an arbitrary set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor"